@startuml
node "Usuário / Navegador" as User
cloud "Internet" as Net
node "Oracle Cloud Linux 9" as VM {
 component "Nginx (proxy reverso)" as N
 component "foodbridge.service (systemd)" as SD
 component "Spring Boot / Kotlin API
Java 21 :8080" as API
 database "PostgreSQL foodbridge" as DB
 file "/etc/foodbridge/application.properties" as Config
}
node "GitHub Actions" as CI
User --> Net
Net --> N
N --> API
SD ..> API : ciclo de vida
API --> DB
API --> Config : configuração externa
CI --> VM : JAR por SSH (quando habilitado)
note right of CI
CI validado, deploy remoto depende
de SSH/known_hosts e preparação.
end note
@enduml
